# Interface README

`endoscopic_tissue/README_interfaces.md` records every operation of the demo interfaces: scene selection, tissue models, environments, fixation, and force readout.

When an operation is added or changed, update that file in the same change, in Chinese, in the file's existing explanatory style. State what it does, which file it lives in, and a command or snippet that runs it. Replace an example that no longer runs.

Include that README update in the commit that uploads the operation. Do not leave a new operation only in the chat.
